<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><v:line id=_x0000_s1029 style="POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LEFT: 0px; Z-INDEX: 4" strokecolor="red" strokeweight="1.75pt" to="418pt,14.9pt" from="-32pt,14.9pt"><w:wrap type="square"></w:wrap></v:line><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体">关于</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体">举办全市职工书法、摄影、<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体">国画等免费培训班的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体; mso-bidi-font-family: 方正小标宋简体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=5>越城区、柯桥区、上虞区总工会，市产业工会，市直部门、系统（开发区）工会（工委），省直协管单位工会：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>为喜迎党的十九大胜利召开，落实省十四次党代会提出的建设“文化浙江”精神，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT size=5>加快构建工会文化服务体系，丰富职工精神文化生活，引导职工关注生活艺术，经研究，决定在<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>年下半年举办全市职工书法、摄影、国画等免费培训班，现将具体事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、培训对象</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">：市直及相关区辖的机关、企事业单位工会会员</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><FONT size=5>二、培训内容及要求</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><FONT size=5>：见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">三、培训时间</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">：晚上</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">19:00</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">—<SPAN lang=EN-US>21:00</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">，每次授课时间两小时，具体以实际课程计划为准，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">开班时间待定。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>四、报名地点</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>：绍兴市鲁迅中路<SPAN lang=EN-US>460</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>号（绍兴市职工中等专业学校老校区内）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><FONT size=5>五、培训地点：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><FONT size=5>绍兴市凤林西路<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>号职工之家二楼（绍兴市职工中等专业学校新校区内）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><FONT size=5><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">六、报名办法</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.25"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">基层工会组织推荐报名，并经所在单位工会及所属部门、系统工会盖章，交绍兴市职工中等专业学校培训科，由市总工会统一审核。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
